"""Scene output coordination and media-artifact assembly.

python-ios-lib's writer is upstream manim 0.22.1's -- resolved settings, the
output plan's paths, sections, sound, joining the segments, cache pruning --
around the encoding engine this library has shipped since manim 0.20, in
place of 0.22's ``VideoSegmentEncoder`` jobs. :class:`SceneFileWriter` says
why, and what host apps rely on.
"""

